        <mxCell id="n6t" value="Composition — cấu thành (phần chết theo tổng thể)" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="445" width="350" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="hint" value="GỢI Ý ĐỌC ĐỀ (khi thấy chữ này → dùng quan hệ này):&#10;&#10;• &quot;is a type of&quot; / &quot;là loại&quot; / A, B, C là các loại của X → Inheritance (kế thừa)&#10;• &quot;implements&quot; / &quot;must implement interface&quot; → Realization (hiện thực interface)&#10;• &quot;has a&quot; / &quot;contains&quot; / &quot;A can have many B&quot; → Association (+ multiplicity)&#10;• &quot;is composed of&quot; / &quot;part of&quot; (phần chết khi tổng thể chết) → Composition (kim cương đen)&#10;• &quot;made up of&quot; nhưng phần vẫn sống độc lập → Aggregation (kim cương rỗng)&#10;• &quot;service depends on / uses repository&quot; → Dependency (mũi tên đứt)&#10;&#10;MULTIPLICITY (số lượng ghi ở 2 đầu association):&#10;• 0..1 : 0 hoặc 1&#10;• n   : bắt buộc đúng n&#10;• 0..* : 0 hoặc nhiều&#10;• 1..* : 1 hoặc nhiều&#10;• m..n : tối thiểu m, tối đa n&#10;&#10;NHỚ: private (-), public (+), protected (#). Attribute: - name: type. Method: + name(): returnType." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=8;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#d6b656;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="740" width="1120" height="360" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ex" value="VÍ DỤ MẪU (đề EMS — Event Management System):&#10;&#10;• User (abstract) &#8592; Student, Lecturer, Organizer, Admin   → INHERITANCE (đề: &quot;are specialized types of User&quot;)&#10;• User &quot;1&quot; ——— &quot;*&quot; Registration   → ASSOCIATION + multiplicity (đề: &quot;a user can register for multiple events&quot;)&#10;• Event &quot;1&quot; ——— &quot;*&quot; Registration   → ASSOCIATION (đề: &quot;each event can have multiple registrations&quot;)&#10;• Event - - -&gt; EventStatus {Planned, OpenForRegistration, Ongoing, Completed, Cancelled}   → ENUM&#10;• EventRepository / RegistrationRepository - - -▷ Repository&lt;T&gt;   → REALIZATION (đề: &quot;must implement Repository&lt;T&gt;&quot;)&#10;• EventService / RegistrationService - - -&gt; Repository   → DEPENDENCY (đề: &quot;service layer depends on repository&quot;)&#10;&#10;Cách đọc ra quan hệ: &quot;specialized types of&quot; = kế thừa | &quot;can have multiple&quot; = association 1..* | &quot;must implement interface&quot; = realization | &quot;depends on&quot; = dependency." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=8;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#82b366;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1120" width="1120" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

